            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nana"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great recipe, but I took it one step further. Instead of the Taco sauce, I used thick salsa &amp; BBQ sauce with the grape Jelly.....totally awesome. Just a little bit of the Salsa goes a long way. 1/4 C of Salsa &amp; 2 C. of BBQ sauce &amp; 1/2 C. grape jelly.Per 15-18 meatballs. It's just me and my husband here.",
